  + justification supports mandatory stability revalidation
  + plan orders implementation and proof
  + stability input validated_by current stability authority
  + successful pair supplies directory seed
  + topology forms validate completed structural projection
  + signature authorizes pure implementation only
  + future root, inventory, physical, Git, traversal, receipt, and admission work requires separate authority

& [RetrievalTerms] include supplied directory topology projection, directory carrier, stability revalidation, stable pair, placement plan, final component, fixed directory mode, absent digest, absent length, output-only lineage, and physical nonclaim

